# 2026-11-07: the idle GPU failed to wake (Xid 79, fallen off the bus) and the 05:00 reboot did not come back.
# Runs after 71-nvidia.rules, which sets auto. Remove when the Xid stays gone on a driver newer than 580.178.04.
ACTION=="add|bind", SUBSYSTEM=="pci", ATTR{vendor}=="0x10de", ATTR{class}=="0x03[0-9]*", ATTR{power/control}="on"
